### 6. Calculated Metrics (Must Be Derivable)

#### Revenue per Employee
- Formula: Total Revenue / Total Employees
- Calculation: AED 485,100,000 / 1,200 = **AED 404,250**

#### Average Deal Size (New Customers)
- Formula: Total Revenue / New Customers Acquired
- Calculation: AED 485,100,000 / 890 = **AED 545,056**

#### Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)
- Formula: Sales & Marketing Spend / New Customers
- Calculation: AED 136,143,000 / 890 = **AED 152,970**

#### Gross Margin
- Formula: (Revenue - COGS) / Revenue
- Calculation: (485,100,000 - 121,275,000) / 485,100,000 = **75.0%**

#### Operating Margin
- Formula: Operating Income / Revenue
- Calculation: -19,719,000 / 485,100,000 = **-4.1%**

#### Monthly Burn Rate
- Formula: Net Loss / 12 months
- Calculation: AED 22,491,000 / 12 = **AED 1,874,250**

#### Runway (Months)
- Formula: Cash on Hand / Monthly Burn
- Calculation: AED 441,000,000 / AED 1,874,250 = **23.5 months**

