## Cross-Reference Format

Documents should reference each other using this format:
- "As outlined in the Security Policy (SEC-001)..."
- "Per the Q3 2024 OKRs (STRAT-003)..."
- "See the Employee Handbook (HR-001) for details..."
- "Refer to the Annual Report 2024 (FIN-001)..."
